The upstream repository is documentation-first; its scripts/ (fetch_twse.py,
fetch_yahoo.py, fetch_news.py, value_investing_analyzer.py) were placeholders
that only built URLs or returned mock JSON. StackFund COMPLETES them with working
data connectors:

  src/stackfund/l1_databook/sources/twse.py   — TWSE OpenAPI STOCK_DAY_ALL
  src/stackfund/l1_databook/sources/yahoo.py  — Yahoo v8 chart API (cross-check)

Adaptations: ETF focus (0050 / 0056 / 00878), StackFund's Core-B firewall and
four-tier disclaimer framing, and the strict "research desk — places no
securities orders" posture.

